WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.400
On first launch, CryoZen asks you to create the admin account.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.800
Enter a password of at least 8 characters and confirm it.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.500
Click Create Admin Account.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
You are signed in and land on Settings, Integrations, ready to connect services.
